"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的用处不是给出精确区间，而是让「这个月 NPS 涨了 3 分」这种判断有一个尺度感——在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很小的时候，这样的波动完全在噪声范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构性指标-一次上门成功率\">结构性指标：一次上门成功率</h2><h3 id=\"为什么它是核心\">为什么它是核心</h3><p>满意度指标有一个固有的弱点：它会被一次诚恳的道歉拉回来。一次失败的送装如果处理得体贴（及时告知、免费改约、补偿），客户的 CSAT 甚至可能高于一次平淡的成功交付。因此<strong>满意度不能单独用来评价送装质量</strong>。</p>\n<p>结构性指标补上这个缺口：<strong>一次上门成功率</strong>（首次上门即完成安装并通过验收的订单占比）不会被道歉影响。它是本 hub 所有设计的最终检验——第 2.2 篇的可达性字段质量、第 1.3 篇的齐套率、第 3.1 篇的工序顺序、第 3.2 篇的技能匹配、第 4.2 篇的返工合并，全部作用于它。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一组应当并置的结构性指标\">一组应当并置的结构性指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>主要关联章节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次上门成功率</td>\n<td>首次上门即验收通过 / 总工单</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返工率</td>\n<td>需二次上门 / 总工单</td>\n<td>4.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加费争议率</td>\n<td>有争议的附加费单 / 收取附加费的单</td>\n<td>2.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可达性档案错误率</td>\n<td>现场发现档案与实际不符 / 总工单</td>\n<td>2.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配件缺失率</td>\n<td>关键件缺失 / 总工单</td>\n<td>1.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>室内损坏率</td>\n<td>发生墙面/地板损坏的 / 总工单</td>\n<td>2.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这六个指标合起来是一张诊断图：如果一次上门成功率下降而配件缺失率上升，问题在库存与分装；如果可达性档案错误率上升，问题在字段采集（第 2.2 篇的三种失败模式）；如果附加费争议率上升，问题在披露与快照（第 2.3 篇）。<strong>没有这层分解，一次上门成功率的下降是无法定位的。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"复购与送装的关系\">复购与送装的关系</h2><h3 id=\"相关性不等于因果\">相关性不等于因果</h3><p>大件是低频高单价品类，复购周期以年计，因此「送装好 → 复购高」这个命题在单个客户层面几乎无法验证（样本期太长）。可行的做法是看<strong>同期的相邻行为</strong>：客户在送装完成后短期内是否购买了同店的配套商品（例如买了床之后买床垫）、是否留下了评价、是否向客服咨询过其他品类。这些是被压缩了周期的代理指标。与之相关的还有一条更早的可测量信号：客户是否选择了旧物回收（第 4.1 篇，<a href=\"../haulaway-damage-exception/old-item-haul-away\">旧物回收（haul-away）</a>），选择回收的客户通常处于替换而非新增购置的决策周期里，其后续行为的分布与新增客户不同，这个分组在分层统计时值得单列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层统计的实现\">分层统计的实现</h3><p>把前面几节的口径固化成一张可查询的宽表，是让这些指标真正能被使用的最后一步。核心是每一行代表一个已完成工单，带上分层维度与所有结构性结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE service_quality_fact (&#10;  order_id            TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  completed_at        DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  category            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  city                TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  crew_id             TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  first_visit_success BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  second_visit_count  SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  had_exception       BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  had_haulaway        BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  surcharge_charged   BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  surcharge_disputed  BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  access_profile_error BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  missing_critical_part BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  csat_day0           NUMERIC(3,1),&#10;  csat_day7           NUMERIC(3,1),&#10;  nps_bucket          TEXT CHECK (nps_bucket IN (&#39;promoter&#39;,&#39;passive&#39;,&#39;detractor&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> service_quality_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  completed_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  city                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crew_id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_visit_success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  second_visit_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  had_exception       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  had_haulaway        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  surcharge_charged   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  surcharge_disputed  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  access_profile_error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  missing_critical_part </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  csat_day0           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  csat_day7           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nps_bucket          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nps_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'promoter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'passive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'detractor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表的设计要点有两条。第一，<strong>分层维度（<code>had_exception</code>、<code>had_haulaway</code>）是列而不是筛选条件</strong>，因为同一份数据要按不同分层反复查询，把分层做成列才能避免每次重算。第二，<strong><code>first_visit_success</code> 是独立列而不是由 <code>second_visit_count = 0</code> 推导</strong>——两者在「客户取消而非失败」「客户自行完成剩余步骤」等边界情况下会不一致，固化成列才能明确取哪个口径。指标看板的全部聚合都从这张表出，不再从订单主表临时拼装，这是让口径稳定的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"送装对复购的真实作用路径\">送装对复购的真实作用路径</h3><p>送装的商业价值大概率不是直接驱动复购，而是通过两条路径起作用：<strong>降低退货与赔付</strong>（送装质量差会推高退货率与赔付成本，这是直接的成本项），以及<strong>保护评分与曝光</strong>（平台侧的店铺评分受交付体验影响，评分影响流量）。把送装的价值建立在这两条上，比假设它能直接带来复购要扎实得多；这两条也都是可测量的，不需要等多年。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSAT 测交易、NPS 测关系，两者在大件场景都要用但要看不同时点：完成当日看服务过程，3–7 天看安装质量，30 天以上看关系倾向。</li>\n<li>样本偏差有三个来源（无响应、挽回、渠道），对策是分层统计而非数值修正；发生过异常与二次上门的样本要单独分层。</li>\n<li>用于送装评价的 NPS 必须限定问题范围，并且不能与公司级 NPS 同榜比较；小样本切片必须同时报告样本量与置信区间。</li>\n<li>满意度会被道歉拉回，因此必须与结构性指标并置；一次上门成功率是本 hub 的核心结果指标，配合返工率、附加费争议率、可达性档案错误率、配件缺失率、室内损坏率构成诊断分解。</li>\n<li>送装对复购的直接因果难以在低频大件上验证；可测量且扎实的价值路径是降低退货与赔付、保护平台评分与曝光。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"送装满意度与复购指标","id":"送装满意度与复购指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采集时机与样本偏差","id":"采集时机与样本偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"时机的选择","id":"时机的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"样本偏差的三个来源","id":"样本偏差的三个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"NPS 在大件场景的正确用法","id":"nps-在大件场景的正确用法"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能直接用 NPS 排名","id":"为什么不能直接用-nps-排名"},{"level":3,"text":"样本量与置信区间","id":"样本量与置信区间"},{"level":2,"text":"结构性指标：一次上门成功率","id":"结构性指标-一次上门成功率"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么它是核心","id":"为什么它是核心"},{"level":3,"text":"一组应当并置的结构性指标","id":"一组应当并置的结构性指标"},{"level":2,"text":"复购与送装的关系","id":"复购与送装的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"相关性不等于因果","id":"相关性不等于因果"},{"level":3,"text":"分层统计的实现","id":"分层统计的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"送装对复购的真实作用路径","id":"送装对复购的真实作用路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"破损与安装失败处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/haulaway-damage-exception/delivery-damage-install-fail"},"next":null}